---
title: "Old Time String Band"
code: "MUS-150"
category: "music"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Introduces the student to the history and performance of traditional old-time string band music of the central Appalachian region with topics on musicians, instrumentation, regional influences, and tunes. Lecture 2 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 4 hours per week.
